---
description: Kubernetes Deployment Patterns
globs: **/*.{yaml,yml,ts,js}
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use Kubernetes manifests for all deployments
- Deployment types:
  - Stateless services → Deployments
  - Scheduled tasks → CronJobs
  - Stateful components → StatefulSets
  - Configuration → ConfigMaps and Secrets

- Resource management:
  - Set resource requests and limits for all containers
  - Implement horizontal pod autoscaling (HPA)
  - Use node affinity for specialized workloads

- Security best practices:
  - Run containers as non-root
  - Use read-only file systems where possible
  - Implement network policies
  - Store secrets in Kubernetes Secrets

- Monitoring and logging:
  - Expose Prometheus metrics
  - Implement structured logging
  - Set up liveness and readiness probes
  - Configure appropriate pod disruption budgets